bscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-05-04T23:48:31Z","updated_at":"2020-05-04T23:48:31Z","body":"`select count(id)` , `select count(1)` work as expected.\r\n\r\nWhen we do `select count(*)`, the RPC to tserver uses:\r\n```\r\ntargets {                                                                                          \r\n    tscall {                                                                                         \r\n      opcode: 4                                                                                      \r\n      operands {                                                                                     \r\n        value {                                                                                      \r\n        }                                                                                            \r\n      }                                                                                              \r\n    }                                                                                                \r\n  }                                                                                                  \r\n  column_refs {                                                                                      \r\n  }   \r\n```\r\n\r\nwhereas, in case of `select count(id)`, it is\r\n```\r\ntargets {                                                                                          \r\n    tscall {                                                                                         \r\n      opcode: 4                                                                                      \r\n      operands {                                                                                     \r\n        column_id: 0                                                                                 \r\n      }                                                                                              \r\n    }                                                                                                \r\n  }                                                                                                  \r\n  column_refs {                                                                                      \r\n    ids: 0                                                                                           \r\n  }\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/623766531/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ndeodhar","id":15746068,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzQ2MDY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15746068?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar","html_url":"https://github.com/ndeodhar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":3302139251,"node_id":"MD